# Mood Taster

Match how you feel to what you should taste. Mood first, menus second.

## Product

- Flow: Eat out or Cook → craving quiz → one dish → act → Taste DNA
- Eat out: nearby places. Cook: catalog recipes (ingredients + steps)
- Specific dishes only, never cuisine categories
- Optional accounts (Supabase); guests work without an account

## Design

- Ghost White `--paper` `#fdfaff`, Indigo `--ink` `#510c85`, Gold `--accent` `#ffdf6e`
- Rounded language (`--radius-card` 20px, buttons 14px). 8px spacing
- No gradients, no outlined buttons, almost no shadows
- Swipe + ♡ × ↻ on the result card
- No emojis. No semantic green/red. No em dashes in copy

## Code

- Types in `src/lib/taste-types.ts`
- Pure `rank()` in `src/lib/engine.ts`
- Storage reads only inside `useEffect` (hydration)
- Prefer small diffs; do not invent features outside BUILD.md scope
- Do not commit secrets or push unless asked
